sequenceDiagram
    participant Dev as Developer / CI
    participant FW as Firewall / Proxy
    participant NPM as npm Registry
    participant SC as OSS Scorecard
    participant Repo as Source Repo

    Dev->>FW: npm install request (package@version)
    FW->>NPM: fetch package metadata
    NPM-->>FW: metadata (incl. source repo URL)
    FW->>SC: run scorecard on repo URL
    SC->>Repo: inspect security practices
    Repo-->>SC: repo data
    SC-->>FW: score (0-10)

    alt score >= threshold (ALLOW)
        FW->>NPM: fetch package tarball
        NPM-->>FW: tarball
        FW-->>Dev: return package
    else score < threshold (BLOCK)
        FW-->>Dev: error + reason (where protocol allows)
    end
